Recommends: gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Description: Unify Desktop Assistant for Ubuntu/Linux
 Sets up your machine as a remote-controllable AI assistant workstation.
 Includes system tray GUI, VNC server, noVNC web viewer, websockify proxy,
 and the AI Agent Service powered by Magnitude browser automation.
 .
 After installation, the Unify Desktop Assistant tray icon appears in your
 system tray. Use it to start/stop services and configure your API key.
 .
 Services: x11vnc (5900), websockify+noVNC (6080), Agent Service (3000)
